criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Men or women;
* Aged between 18 and 65 years;
* Speaking French fluently;
* Having a professional activity in France;
* Having a hierarchical superior and colleagues;
* Working at least part-time;
* Working in the current organization for at least three months;
* Agreeing to participate in the study.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Minors or over 65 years of age;
* Pregnant women;
* Without professional activity in France;
* Not proficient in French;
* Having no hierarchical superior (e.g., being a company head) or colleagues (e.g., a self-employed worker);
* Working less than half time;
* Working in the current organization for less than three months;
* Refusing to participate in the study
